                <mxCell id="tree-v30" value="&lt;b&gt;Dispatch inside one tool&lt;/b&gt; (ToolFrame.dispatch)&lt;br&gt;1. active subtools, latest first — an &lt;i&gt;exclusive&lt;/i&gt; one hides the event from its parent&lt;br&gt;2. idle subtools in registration order — first matching trigger activates&lt;br&gt;3. on_event()&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Subtools are only reachable through their parent →&lt;br&gt;their shortcuts only work while the parent tool is in use." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
